      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WINLOCK BOBBY (2) rocketed out of the inside draw with a strong early sectional and gave a sight but had to settle for a placing, finishing second (18.38) at Dubbo over 318m. Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. Capable of going well again. WESTSIDE TANGO (8) was a last start winner (19.39) at this track who is building a strong winning record. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Hard to fault her recent form and can win again. EFFERVESCENCE (3) finished second (19.00) two back at this track but out of the placings last time when 6th there. Form here at the trip sound including three wins. Bold showing expected. DYLAN'S DESTINY (1) has been in the money at his last two runs, most recently when third (19.40) in a Grade 5 over 330m at this track.",
